<title>CANADA: WCE western barley futures set record trade volume.</title>
<headline>WCE western barley futures set record trade volume.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western feed barley futures on the Winnipeg Commodity Exchange set a record in volume of trade Tuesday and Thursday, a WCE marketing official said.</p>
<p>Western barley volume hit a new record Tuesday at 4,041 contracts exchanged and another record Thursday when volume reached 4,401, the official said.</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
